menu "Folio diagnostics"

config FOLIO_METRICS
    bool "Emit local software timing and heap observations"
    default n
    help
        Emit fixed-tag JSON records for instrumented input, render and display
        boundaries. This adds timer, heap-query and serial-log overhead.
        Disabled builds do not evaluate metric arguments or emit metric logs.
        Observations are not optical screen latency or electrical power data.

endmenu
